{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_spuria_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_spuria_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "銃聲迴響",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spuria_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "41f33ab6688222113f428aab5b548a4fbcb9f240d7c386ba26998a70b87f54d6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g6_laterano_chapelin"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1099年5月\n拉特蘭，安魂教堂"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你帶的炸藥挺不錯嘛！如果老先生在棺材裡還能聽到的話，一定會很開心的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "矜持的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？那就好。我聽說他離世前一週還參加了養老院的爆破競速賽，所以我想他會喜歡的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，不會吧，今天來參加葬禮的人居然這麼多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為你見到我的時候會更開心一點哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是覺得……這裡離城區還挺遠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，畢竟是教過我們的老師的葬禮，菲亞梅塔和莫斯提馬又不在拉特蘭，只好我代她們來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，是因為公務來的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "養老院那些不方便行動的老人想看葬禮的現場直播，這種時候一定會找上我們部門，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來你已經適應教皇廳的工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然啦，我可是一直努力想追上學姊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是啊，莉雅，我不是你的老師，也不能給你的作品打分數哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉，真希望我們不是都有光環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然那樣也很難逃過學姐的眼睛就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，我記得你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師曾向我們展示過你的爆炸物設計作業！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，居然不是因為違規被她抓住嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那應該主要是菲亞梅塔的功勞吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，這位老師教我們的時候就已經快一百歲了，但那時他還很有精神呢，聲音也很洪亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，老師是這兩年才離開學校安心養老的，畢竟他真的很喜歡研究爆炸物嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且學校離他最喜歡的甜點店也比較近，還沒有人會管他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……老師在遺囑裡說自己已經了無遺憾，但我還是會想到，他再也吃不到季節限定新品仙人掌塔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我聞到傷感的氣息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，不好意思……老師終於回歸崇高聖靈的時刻，我怎麼能想仙人掌塔的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該把保險栓拉開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，還是爆炸聲適合葬禮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的拉特蘭人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去那邊的空地上來個三連發射擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那我也去維持秩序……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了，莉雅，不再聊一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說我住院的時候，你可是堅持不懈地向小樂打聽了一年多，才要到我的病房號碼呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，學姐真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也只是想關心一下你嘛。畢竟準確來說，我現在已經不能算你的“學姐”了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我睡覺的時間裡，你應該看到了很多東西，經歷了很多事情才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莉雅，你有推開門去看看嗎？有讓科技更好地為人所用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真狡猾啊，學姐，明知道這其實是我想問你的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g8_laterano_dwelling"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1100年1月\n拉特蘭，可露麗大街，某處民居"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我現在算是長期外派人員了，絕不在教皇廳多待一分鐘的那種。安布羅修修道院的修復工作，我這邊可幫不上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣，我這邊還有事呢，先掛啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熟悉的源石火藥味，熟悉的爆破實驗聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡直就跟以前翹課跑來這裡的時候一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那座修道院裡發生過的事情，在這裡回想起來，總覺得很不真實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難怪那些歷史學得好的傢伙喜歡把“長存的樂園”掛在嘴邊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，人不在嗎？門上明明掛著“歡迎光臨”的牌子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真無趣！你怎麼就把我的小機關燒短路了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會吧，阿瑪莉大師，您就是這麼歡迎客人的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是發射一團奶油而已，你要是反應夠快，可以剛好用嘴巴接住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我是工匠欸，又不是訓練用的循獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵。坐吧，斯普莉雅。有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我手上有一把銃要改造。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，一把老古董。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "銃的持有者……\n不是薩科塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想要用銃，結果卻造成了走火的狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把銃對她來說還挺重要的，所以我答應她，她可以把銃留在身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——當然，要等我改造一下才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，但是要讓其他種族的人也能用銃，這可是個大難題啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，我這裡也有位客人，給了我一把走了火的銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不如先拿這個找靈感吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不就是一把普通的銃嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，好吧，看在我們的關係上，我當然願意幫您工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我聽說你被從城區辦事處提拔到教皇廳了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會吧，您這麼不關心自己的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒去教皇廳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去了，而且剛剛提了辭職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然沒辭職成功，只是拿到了一個長期外派人員的身分，不過至少不用跟我那位嘮叨的上司每天坐在一個辦公室裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就說啦，當工匠比較適合你。是不是又惹事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，我還以為自己在城區辦事處這幾年遇到的麻煩事已經夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果，我還是沒當成一個好工匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真可惜，我還指望你以後每次來看我的時候都帶點教皇廳門口的子彈頭餅乾，省得我自己叫外送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，之前你用來捉弄去辦事處的小孩那幾個發明，我確實很喜歡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——哦，你手裡那把銃的主人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔顧客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，對銃械這麼疏於保養可是會出問題的哦。你看，這把“銃”的阻鐵有些磨損，我們得換個新的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，還得再加一重保險機制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔顧客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給您添麻煩了。不過，我的女兒只有三歲，她想要的可能不是這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔顧客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然她偷偷折騰我的銃導致了走火，但她想要的其實是商場裡能噴出彩虹糖的玩具銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔顧客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我希望能將這把“銃”改成她想要的樣子，作為她的出院禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩科塔顧客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_368_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，您不用擔心，“銃”雖然走火了，但我的女兒和丈夫都沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好……你們還挺幸運的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜託，阿瑪麗大師，您怎麼沒有事先告訴我這個客人想要什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你不是也沒有告訴我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銃械維修師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個人如果不是薩科塔，為什麼一定要用銃？這不是很奇怪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，我該去直接問她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g6_villagestreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……天真冷啊，我們必須快點把這塊擋風板釘好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕克，可以來幫個忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕克？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別跟他浪費時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……因為是我在叫他，所以他不會回答？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在誰這麼叫他，他都不回答，就因為這個名字是你提議的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天打獵的時候，我會給他點教訓的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣不好，萊蒙德，我不想再跟人吵架了，更不希望用武力……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道……但前提是，他能好好地跟人說話，而不是這麼一聲不吭地瞪著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他到底有沒有搞清楚，是你救了他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，在吵架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——咳，你好啊，斯普莉雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們收到你的信了，但其實你不用事先通知，我們實在沒什麼可以準備的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，之前說好的青草格子餅，我也做不出來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正巧，我匿名聯絡了一支商隊，他們很快就會繞路到這裡來跟你們做生意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "商隊？！\n太好了，斯普莉雅……這下我們能在冬天多堅持一段時間了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯，確實是救命的物資，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜，到時候你躲好，我來交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見商隊的時候戴好兜帽，還有，別被騙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……我知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，斯普莉雅……還有一件事我必須向你道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說過我的樣子不能讓太多人看到，尤其是其他薩卡茲，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，我們先進屋，你再慢慢交代。搞不好我不會生氣哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，那個年輕薩卡茲就是你們新收留的成員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，按照教皇廳給我的守則，這算是違反律法的行為吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對、對不起……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，畢竟他是受了傷被你們救回來的，教宗那麼和藹的老爺爺應該能理解吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，你說他原本跟著一支隊伍去卡茲戴爾，但因為受傷脫隊了，那支隊伍裡的人也不會再接納他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那看來他只能定居在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我希望他留下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要他不到處亂跑，這裡有墮天使的消息就不會散播出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，寫報告也很麻煩，要不就在報告裡隱瞞這件事好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是……這樣沒問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定會有哦，所以下次別再犯了，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，你一直戴著兜帽，永遠不拿出你的銃，這樣也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好……我會試著去做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經在學著用手弩了，最近幾次狩獵，我也跟著去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很難……啊，我不是說使用手弩很難，而是要維持生活很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去在修道院裡，我總是相信，虔誠祈禱之人自然會領到他的聖餐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我仍然會和蘇拉爾還有其他幾個人一起祈禱，但我們都知道事情變得不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，只是提醒你，記得你的身分，不要說出相關的概念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯，我記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你受到的影響大嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然失去了共感能力，但你身邊本來也沒有別的薩科塔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，我越來越清楚地感覺到自己失去了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像一直在走夜路。盲目，感覺不到其他人……孤獨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我知道，這片黑暗我永遠走不出去了，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊，抱歉，這些應該不是寫報告需要的內容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我還挺樂意聽的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，你的這把銃我還沒改造完呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "福爾圖娜，你想要拿這把銃做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是很害怕它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我必須握住它，我不能就這樣放下菲娜的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等一下，福爾圖娜。我想歡迎一位客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別躲在窗底下了，我的無人機盯著你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不要這麼緊張嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看得出來，你在懷疑我們薩科塔會聯合起來做什麼對薩卡茲不利的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這樣，為什麼不進來旁聽？外面那麼冷，進屋少吹點風也不壞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們絕對沒有想傷害你的意思，帕克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我們繼續說你的事吧。只要把事情說清楚，沒有共感的人也能互相理解吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還要改你的銃呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我想克服自己的恐懼，找回一些安心的感覺，就像以前我握住銃的時候得到的回應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且來到這裡之後，我總是想，如果能把那種感覺分享給其他人就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為……以前主教爺爺總是能安慰每一個去找他的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我們已經離開他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你竟然開始動手改了。我這樣的想法，不會很無理取鬧嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可沒說我會照著你的願望來改哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我確實有了一些靈感。等我改好，可別忘了感謝我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，現在幾點了？昨晚我又是幾點才改好那把銃的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅，斯普莉雅……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起……對不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "銃……不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，帕克也不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚放哨的人都沒看見他……該死的，那傢伙清楚大家輪崗的習慣，我們也沒想過要防自己人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，斯普莉雅，我們一定把他抓回來，已經有一隊人準備出發了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼著急啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可是我改造的武器，它去了哪裡，我還是心裡有數的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你從一開始就提防他了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以猜猜我有沒有提防小福爾圖娜跑掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——開玩笑的，總之，你們不用這麼緊張，放輕鬆一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和福爾圖娜兩個人去追他就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，還有一件事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，雖然對外派人員的資材消耗統計很寬鬆，但監管墮天使的任務裡用掉的子彈還是要回報，所以我會寬容一些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想聽到這句話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯，多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡有血跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅……真的是這個方向嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少你的銃一定在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你說你已經把銃改好了，即使是我也能用，那帕克是不是也可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是很希望他會試試看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那……這是誰的血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶……哈，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不就是你們想看的嗎，該死的薩科塔！這是我的血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況糟糕啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕克……是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是被野獸撕裂的傷口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴……給我滾開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死在牙獸嘴裡，也好過死在你們的圈套裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圈套？怎麼會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明聽到我們在聊什麼了……我們不想傷害任何人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅還幫大家弄到了過冬的物資！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，你們就是用這種方式騙其他薩卡茲留下來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們為什麼不回家？除了卡茲戴爾，薩卡茲怎麼可能有別的家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾……究竟是什麼地方？萊蒙德從來沒有告訴我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……福爾圖娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有去過安布羅修修道院的人，恐怕是很難理解你們的生活方式的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……不去想那麼多，只是住在這裡，有一個安穩過冬的屋簷，不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去想那麼多？咳、咳咳……你騙不了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這群頂著光環的混蛋，一輩子都在騙人，一輩子都在裝聖人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不可能不恨薩卡茲，你們只是在等一個好機會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……一對薩卡茲的角，值多少錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我不知道！我真的不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……看來，你偷走福爾圖娜的銃，是出於類似的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早知道我會死，我就該先把你們的頭割下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……先把它還回來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……別拿走它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一把薩科塔的銃，足夠我回到隊伍……被尊重……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是這把銃我已經改造過了，它根本就……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“偷走遺產銃可是非常嚴重的違背律法的行為哦，斯普莉雅，就算你說那是老師上課的教具也沒用。”\n“不過，老師們也很好奇，你這個一節課都沒聽的天才，究竟能從一把銃上研究出什麼。”\n“是哦，遺產銃都是些老古董，輕輕鬆鬆就能拆解。”\n“再怎麼翻來覆去地看，能看到的也只有兩種技術。一種我們現代人根本用不上，另一種則是基礎中的基礎。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“但是，莉雅，你有試過握住它祈禱嗎？”\n“或者說，你能想像是什麼人，在什麼情形下曾握住它祈禱嗎？”\n“那時聖城尚未建起，世上還沒有樂園……很難想像吧？”\n“可是如果不去理解那樣的時代，你要怎麼研究他們的遺產呢？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯普莉雅，你怎麼……突然開火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斯普莉雅維持著將自己的銃指向洞口空曠處的姿勢，又一次扣動扳機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別緊張嘛，只是……拉特蘭人就是這樣辦葬禮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死亡的沉重也好，別離的痛苦也好，遺憾和憤怒也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都能被熱鬧的爆炸聲沖淡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有第二名薩科塔的銃聲，沒有連環爆炸，沒有尖叫和大笑。\n在一聲又一聲的銃響之中，福爾圖娜深吸了一口氣，從斯普莉雅手中拿過了自己的那把銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以保證，它現在絕對安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是害怕的話，你可以閉上眼睛。我會幫你看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我應該要看著，然後記住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，閉上眼睛。手臂朝著這個方向……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "福爾圖娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_927_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這把銃已經當不了戰利品了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯普莉雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_4015_spuria_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它已經不是銃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不需要薩科塔的射擊天賦也能使用，能夠分享簡單的快樂。\n五顏六色的紙片和彩帶從銃口噴出，掛在兩人的頭髮上。\n銃聲迴盪著，彩色的碎屑紛紛飄落。\n只是在場的人臉上，都沒有笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
